##$TITLE_FILE=Spintropy Username jyarger
2026_05_11_Aspirin_Melted_CDCl3_TMS_Bruker500
30 mg o-acetylsalicylic acid (aspirin) melting in tube
It recrystallized and looked 'foggy' in the tube!
Dissolve the melted solid in 0.6 ml CDCl3 w/ TMS.
(a small amount did NOT dissolve after 5 min)
Mixed at 6:55 pm on 05/10/26.  5 mm sure seal NMR tube.

